<span lang="ES-TRAD" style="font-size:11.0pt;layout-grid-mode:line">FIG. 4.32.
HUESO VOMER. VISTA LATERAL DERECHA.</span><span lang="ES-TRAD" style="font-size:8.0pt;
layout-grid-mode:line">-1,</span><font size="3"><span style="layout-grid-mode: line" lang="ES-TRAD"> alas del vómer.<span style="layout-grid-mode: line"><o:p>
</span>
</span></font><span lang="ES-TRAD" style="font-size:11.0pt;layout-grid-mode:line">
</o:p>
</span>
</p>
